          "@value": "Set the life-cycle status (`adms:status`, W3C DCAT 3 §6.4.30) on a Data Sharing Agreement's DCAT 3 catalogue record when the agreement is amended, renewed, terminated, or expires, while keeping all published versions readable at their immutable URLs (DSA building block B3, process step P14.5 `Task_SetStatus`)."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "dsa-catalogue-status",
      "dcterms:source": "folio-assistant-core/skills/content/folio-document-adapter/dsa-catalogue-status.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
